(7685407, 1258237, 60495, '<td valign="top">One of the saddest things I have witnessed during all this is people living in Nursing  or Assisted Living homes not being allowed to be with family. They allow window visits but can not have any contact with the people or family outside of the facility. To have to live out your last days without having family around you is a horrible existence, this photo brings that to mind for me.</td>', 'One of the saddest things I have witnessed during all this is people living in Nursing  or Assisted Living homes not being allowed to be with family. They allow window visits but can not have any contact with the people or family outside of the facility. To have to live out your last days without having family around you is a horrible existence, this photo brings that to mind for me.', '2021-01-26 14:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
