(7685436, 1258188, 3306, '<td valign="top">I see this is your first challenge. Congratulations on taking your first step towards becoming a better photographer. There is so much to learn! I have been on DPC for almost 19 years. If you take a look at my  first few entries and see where I am now you will get an idea of what you can achieve (even better than me) if you stick with it and have fun. Dont get discouraged if you dont score as well as you had hoped. It happens to all of us. Just keep learning!</td>', 'I see this is your first challenge. Congratulations on taking your first step towards becoming a better photographer. There is so much to learn! I have been on DPC for almost 19 years. If you take a look at my  first few entries and see where I am now you will get an idea of what you can achieve (even better than me) if you stick with it and have fun. Dont get discouraged if you dont score as well as you had hoped. It happens to all of us. Just keep learning!', '2021-01-27 05:16:09.000000', NULL, 0),
